1
00:00:43,242 --> 00:00:46,555
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 5=

3
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,201
Ye Shen.

4
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:56,761
Do you think

5
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,440
it will end today?

6
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,600
Will dawn break?

7
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,650
I don't know either.

8
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,095
Wait, Ye Shen.

9
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,880
You haven't told me

10
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,560
how you entered the loop.

11
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,200
Did you also die?

12
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,560
You were also reborn?

13
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,040
I've never died.

14
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,958
Then how come you...

15
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,128
A doctor?

16
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,560
No wonder you have

17
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:33,280
all those strange books at home.

18
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,720
I work at a private hospital,

19
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:37,800
providing exclusive medical services

20
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,240
for the elite families in this city.

21
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,232
So,

22
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,800
every time you got hurt,

23
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,600
you were brought to me.

24
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,440
I was the one who gave you
the final rescue.

25
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,536
(The first time,)

26
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,960
(the champagne tower's glass
nearly shredded you.)

27
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:55,160
(There were 147 stitches.)

28
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,040
(I gave you 147 stitches in total.)

29
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,309
(The second time,)

30
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,960
(the allergy nearly
destroyed your skin.)

31
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,960
(You loved to look your best,)

32
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,880
(but ended up with such a fate.)

33
00:02:12,792 --> 00:02:14,120
All of this happened

34
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,280
because of my choice.

35
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,320
How could it be your fault?

36
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,440
Every loop

37
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,080
and every death

38
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,160
was caused by those people.

39
00:02:28,043 --> 00:02:29,760
(From the very first loop,)

40
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:34,080
(I watched you die in front of me
every single time.)

41
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,680
(I tried everything to bring you back,)

42
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,880
(but I could never change your fate.)

43
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,440
Dr. Ye,

44
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,520
stop saving her.

45
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,680
The patient is beyond saving.

46
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:16,949
So,

47
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,600
since fate has given us this chance,

48
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,560
we can definitely change the outcome.

49
00:03:25,414 --> 00:03:26,921
Ye Shen,

50
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,920
have you ever thought

51
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,400
about what if this loop

52
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,040
never ends?

53
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,880
Then I'll stay with you

54
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,080
until you find true freedom.

55
00:03:53,907 --> 00:03:54,960
Watch out!

56
00:04:11,915 --> 00:04:13,198
Ye Shen?

57
00:04:15,025 --> 00:04:16,243
Ye Shen!

58
00:04:17,451 --> 00:04:18,670
Ye Shen!

59
00:04:20,155 --> 00:04:21,277
Ye Shen!

60
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,238
Ye Shen!

61
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,881
Gu Xiaotang!

62
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,440
You wretch!

63
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:45,640
You humiliated me in front of everyone!

64
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,720
Now the Lu family has cast me aside!

65
00:04:53,115 --> 00:04:54,451
(If I just run away now,)

66
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,000
(even if the loop ends,)

67
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,438
(Ye Shen will never come back.)

68
00:05:00,842 --> 00:05:02,480
I'll kill you!

69
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,960
I'll kill you!

70
00:05:43,122 --> 00:05:44,522
Lu Qingyuan,

71
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,675
see

72
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,246
you

73
00:05:49,887 --> 00:05:51,223
next time.

74
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,040
Ye Shen.

75
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,593
Ye Shen!

76
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,727
Why am I at home?

77
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,944
What's going on?

78
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,200
Today isn't the wedding day.

79
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,271
The loop

80
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,720
is a full week earlier.

81
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:36,207
(One week before the wedding)

82
00:06:36,207 --> 00:06:37,244
Baby.

83
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,583
(Lu Qingyuan.)

84
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,120
I brought you roses.

85
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,120
What's wrong, Xiaotang?

86
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,200
Are you feeling unwell?

87
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,040
What's wrong, Xiaotang?

88
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,978
Don't touch me!

89
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,084
Xiaotang?

90
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,174
What's wrong? It's me.

91
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,040
We're getting married in a week, honey.

92
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,920
(No, I can't let him get suspicious.)

93
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:24,200
(It's a week before everything happens.)

94
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,600
(I don't know where Ye Shen is yet.)

95
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,000
(I'm completely alone now.)

96
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,057
(I can't provoke him.)

97
00:07:29,623 --> 00:07:31,480
I-I'm a bit hypoglycemic.

98
00:07:32,413 --> 00:07:33,428
I feel dizzy.

99
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,640
You scared me.

100
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,730
Then get up.
I'll warm some milk for you, okay?

101
00:07:36,730 --> 00:07:38,320
No need. I have to go.

102
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,080
Xiaotang, I'm here.

103
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,560
Look what I brought you.

104
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,360
Those super delicious croissants.

105
00:08:01,857 --> 00:08:03,520
Are you going out so early?

106
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:26,120
What's her problem again?

107
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,520
I find it strange as well.

108
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,880
Why did the loop start earlier?

109
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:37,542
Was it because of Ye Shen's death

110
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,080
or my choice?

111
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,657
Could

112
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,680
the loop's rules have changed?

113
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,440
I'm back to seven days ago.

114
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,298
So it means nothing has happened.

115
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:51,640
It also means
everything could happen again.

116
00:08:53,018 --> 00:08:54,108
No,

117
00:08:54,204 --> 00:08:55,583
I must find Ye Shen immediately.

118
00:08:57,378 --> 00:09:00,349
(Outpatient Clinic)

119
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,095
Dr. Ye.

120
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,333
Ye Shen!

121
00:09:26,844 --> 00:09:29,476
♪Time falls like dust upon you♪

122
00:09:29,476 --> 00:09:32,988
♪You don't have to walk the path alone♪

123
00:09:33,598 --> 00:09:36,405
♪In the instant the wind rises♪

124
00:09:37,136 --> 00:09:39,807
♪Dust illuminates you like stars♪

125
00:09:39,807 --> 00:09:43,272
♪You don't have to count every flicker♪

126
00:09:43,794 --> 00:09:46,765
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

127
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,280
I thought I'd never see you again.

128
00:09:52,654 --> 00:09:54,449
It's so good to see you again.

129
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,440
Why did the loop start earlier?

130
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,320
Xiaotang?

131
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:04,742
What are you doing here?

132
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,040
Don't you remember the loop?

133
00:10:11,443 --> 00:10:12,843
The loop?

134
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,080
What loop?

135
00:10:16,808 --> 00:10:18,528
(Oh no, he doesn't remember.)

136
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,435
(Am I the only one who came back?)

137
00:10:22,226 --> 00:10:23,519
Gu Xiaotang,

138
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:25,440
you actually still remember me?

139
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,207
Of course I remember.

140
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,840
We were high school classmates.

141
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,600
We...

142
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:36,120
We've been through so much together.

143
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,139
Xiaotang.

144
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,800
Running out in such a panic,

145
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,803
you came here to meet your classmate.

146
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:49,000
Lu Qingyuan, you followed me?

147
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,397
How could that be?

148
00:10:52,397 --> 00:10:53,487
I was worried about you.

149
00:10:53,712 --> 00:10:55,560
You ran out
when having a hypoglycemic episode.

150
00:10:58,457 --> 00:10:59,590
And

151
00:10:59,975 --> 00:11:01,280
Xiaotang's classmate...

152
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,280
Ye Shen?

153
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,320
You're a doctor.

154
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,240
It's a tough profession, isn't it?

155
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,800
Earning so little money each month.

156
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,571
Too tough.

157
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,520
You were Xiaotang's classmate.

158
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,440
Why not come work for me?

159
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:25,480
Xiaotang is always good to her friends.

160
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,335
I know her very well.

161
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,880
You don't know her.

162
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:32,625
Can't you see she's unhappy right now?

163
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,120
She's my wife.

164
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,600
Of course I know her.

165
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,775
Not yet.

166
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:53,760
What do you mean?

167
00:11:58,724 --> 00:12:00,240
What are you trying to say?

168
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,000
(No,)

169
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,360
(Ye Shen doesn't remember the loop now.)

170
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,720
(I shouldn't drag him into this mess.)

171
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,400
(He's already died for me once.)

172
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,400
Lu Qingyuan,

173
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,772
the wedding prep isn't done yet.

174
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,360
Let's go back first.

175
00:12:15,578 --> 00:12:16,604
Alright.

176
00:12:22,055 --> 00:12:23,080
By the way,

177
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,680
Mr. Ye,

178
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,468
since you were Xiaotang's classmate,

179
00:12:26,468 --> 00:12:27,911
you should also come to our wedding.

180
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,640
No need for a gift.

181
00:13:11,644 --> 00:13:15,000
♪The face deep in the heart♪

182
00:13:15,192 --> 00:13:17,654
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

183
00:13:19,029 --> 00:13:22,729
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

184
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:25,380
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

185
00:13:25,527 --> 00:13:27,899
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

186
00:13:28,049 --> 00:13:30,806
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

187
00:13:30,806 --> 00:13:33,127
♪Even for just a second♪

188
00:13:34,472 --> 00:13:37,935
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

189
00:13:38,063 --> 00:13:39,912
♪And sunlight reverses♪

190
00:13:39,912 --> 00:13:43,382
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

191
00:13:43,738 --> 00:13:45,812
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

192
00:13:46,314 --> 00:13:49,723
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

193
00:13:49,980 --> 00:13:55,192
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

194
00:13:56,446 --> 00:13:59,011
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

195
00:13:59,053 --> 00:14:02,506
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

196
00:14:03,083 --> 00:14:06,046
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

197
00:14:06,791 --> 00:14:09,399
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

198
00:14:09,399 --> 00:14:13,022
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

199
00:14:13,492 --> 00:14:17,548
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
